                <li class="ons-list__item">An adjustment has been made to data prior to YE March 2020 for police forces who are now using the NDQIS tool and the total for England and Wales. Please see our methodology note <a href="#" aria-disabled="true" class="ons-link--disabled">Police recorded offences involving knives or sharp instruments: methodology changes</a>.</li>
